# ============================================================
# vertex — .gitignore
# Added as part of the Sept 2026 exposed-key remediation.
# Goal: nothing that can hold a live credential ever gets committed again.
# ============================================================

# --- Secrets / env files -------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Workers local dev vars (this is where secrets go LOCALLY,
# never in wrangler.jsonc "vars"). Wrangler auto-loads this file.
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Any raw key/credential files someone might drop in the repo root
*.pem
*.key
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
credentials.json

# --- Cloudflare / Wrangler tooling ---------------------------------------
.wrangler/
.mf/
wrangler.toml.bak

# --- Node -----------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
package-lock.json.bak

# --- OS / editor junk -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Vercel -----------------------------------------------------------------
.vercel/
